        "text": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">I</span> is sufficient, <span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">II</span> is sufficient, and <span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">III</span> is sufficient.</p>"
