        "id": "C",
        "text": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">II</span> is sufficient and <span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">III</span> is sufficient, but <span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">I</span> is not.</p>"
